text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_08171D83 {
    "I love GRASS-type POKéMON!\pDo you have any GRASS-type POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_08171DC2 {
    "Oh?\pYou like GRASS-type POKéMON, too,\ndon’t you?\pI’m so happy, you can have this!\nIt’s a token of our friendship."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_08171E34 {
    "I check trees with my GRASS-type\nPOKéMON. I’m like a tree doctor."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_08171E76 {
    "ワ ROUTE 123\nロ ROUTE 118"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_08171E8E {
    "ル MT. PYRE\n“Forbidden to the faint of heart.”"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_08171EBC {
    "BERRY MASTER’S HOUSE"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081BFF6A {
    "Want to determine how strong you are?\nI’ll be the test!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081BFFA2 {
    "You passed with flying colors!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081BFFC1 {
    "To best even me...\nYour strength is marvelous!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C009E {
    "They say that good times are filled\nwith good aromas."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C00D4 {
    "Oh...\nI smell the bitter scent of misery..."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0100 {
    "The BERRY MASTER’s garden is filled\nwith uplifting fragrances."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C013F {
    "Being a psychic is about willpower.\pI’ve willed myself not to lose to\nanyone. That makes me strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C01A3 {
    "I feel sad..."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C01B1 {
    "Being a psychic is about willpower.\nI thought I wouldn’t lose to you..."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C01F9 {
    "I’ve convinced myself that I won’t\nlose anymore. That makes me strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0240 {
    "I feel sad..."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C024E {
    "I should train at MT. PYRE...\nI’ll never beat you this way..."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C028C {
    "Don’t be too happy if your POKéMON\ndevelop psychic powers.\pYou need to refine those powers to\nmake them really useful."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0303 {
    "Astounding!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C030F {
    "We all have psychic powers.\nWe’ve just forgotten how to use them."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0351 {
    "Have you awoken the psychic powers\nwithin you?"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0380 {
    "Astounding!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C038C {
    "Your power with POKéMON...\nThat could be a psychic power, too."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C03CB {
    "MIU: Hello, TRAINER. I hope your\nPOKéMON won’t cry when they lose."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C040E {
    "MIU: Uh-oh, we lost."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0423 {
    "MIU: TRAINER, your POKéMON are\nstrong because you are friends."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0462 {
    "MIU: It’s no fun to battle if you\ndon’t have two POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C049C {
    "YUKI: Okay!\nWe’re beating the TRAINER’s POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C04CD {
    "YUKI: Uh-oh, we lost."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C04E3 {
    "YUKI: Why are you so strong?\nWe’ve never lost before."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0519 {
    "YUKI: It’s no fun to battle if you\ndon’t have two POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C0554 {
    "MT. PYRE...\nWhere the spirits of POKéMON sleep...\lWill your POKéMON sleep?"
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C059F {
    "Overflowing with vitality..."
}

text Naranja_Route123_G00_M38_Text_081C05BC {
    "MT. PYRE...\nWhere the spirits of POKéMON sleep...\pIt must overflow with a power that\nsoothes spirits..."
}
